 "nl": [
  "No packet from dns-servers may enter engineering, even for services open to everyone.",
  "Any zone may connect to database over DNS over UDP 53.",
  "guest-wifi is isolated: it may only reach engineering on syslog (UDP 514), and nothing else.",
  "Hosts in student-lab may reach ntp-servers over LDAP (TCP 389) and SMB (TCP 445).",
  "guest-wifi must accept PostgreSQL (TCP 5432) and MySQL (TCP 3306) from printers.",
  "dns-servers must accept DNS over UDP 53 and SNMP (UDP 161) and SSH (TCP 22) from backup.",
  "Permit any UDP port from dns-servers to admin but deny SNMP (UDP 161), TFTP (UDP 69).",
  "database must accept SSH (TCP 22) and DNS over UDP 53 and RTSP (TCP 554) from backup.",
  "Hosts in vpn-users may reach engineering over SSH (TCP 22) and IMAP (TCP 143).",
  "Allow vpn-users to connect to guest-wifi using syslog (UDP 514) and HTTP (TCP 80).",
  "backup is isolated: it may only reach printers on HTTPS (TCP 443); printers on HTTPS (TCP 443), and nothing else.",
  "Hosts in vpn-users may reach backup over SMB (TCP 445) and syslog (UDP 514) and PostgreSQL (TCP 5432).",
  "Restrict admin so that its only permitted destinations are ntp-servers on syslog (UDP 514); drop all other traffic it originates.",
  "Allow admin to connect to database using PostgreSQL (TCP 5432) and SSH (TCP 22).",
  "Make DNS over UDP 53 on printers reachable from all internal zones.",
  "Hosts in database may reach admin over LDAP (TCP 389) and SNMP (UDP 161).",
  "Make NTP (UDP 123) and DNS over UDP 53 on guest-wifi reachable from all internal zones.",
  "engineering may use any TCP port towards vpn-users, except RDP (TCP 3389), FTP (TCP 21), SMB (TCP 445), which must be blocked.",
  "Any zone may connect to engineering over HTTPS (TCP 443).",
  "Any zone may connect to guest-wifi over NTP (UDP 123).",
  "database must accept RTSP (TCP 554) and SMTP (TCP 25) from dns-servers.",
  "Hosts in ntp-servers may reach database over PostgreSQL (TCP 5432) and RDP (TCP 3389) and NTP (UDP 123).",
  "dns-servers may use TCP ports 1024-65535 towards printers, except RDP (TCP 3389), PostgreSQL (TCP 5432), MySQL (TCP 3306), which must be blocked.",
  "Hosts in vpn-users may reach admin over PostgreSQL (TCP 5432) and MySQL (TCP 3306).",
  "vpn-users must accept HTTPS (TCP 443) and IMAP (TCP 143) and RTSP (TCP 554) from ntp-servers.",
  "Allow guest-wifi to connect to engineering using MySQL (TCP 3306) and PostgreSQL (TCP 5432).",
  "ntp-servers must accept DNS over UDP 53 and HTTP (TCP 80) and LDAP (TCP 389) from backup.",
  "No packet from dns-servers may enter ntp-servers, even for services open to everyone.",
  "Allow student-lab to connect to vpn-users using RTSP (TCP 554) and LDAP (TCP 389) and SMB (TCP 445).",
  "Make DNS over UDP 53 and NTP (UDP 123) on ntp-servers reachable from all internal zones."
 ],
